# Base URL of the FastAPI backend, used only by the native (Capacitor) build.
#
# Leave empty for the web app. The Vite dev server proxies /api to
# http://localhost:8000, and the production build served by FastAPI uses the
# same origin, so a relative /api is correct in both.
#
# A WebView loads from https://localhost, where a relative /api reaches
# nothing. Set this to an absolute URL the device can reach, such as
# http://192.168.1.17:8000 for a phone on the same Wi-Fi as the dev machine.
# The backend must listen on 0.0.0.0 for that to work.
VITE_API_BASE=
